WEBVTT

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.687
Harry.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.541
You did everything you could.
No one could win against that old hag.

00:00:48.707 --> 00:00:51.043
Even Dumbledore
didn't see this coming.

00:00:51.961 --> 00:00:53.849
Harry, if it's anyone's fault, it's ours.

00:00:54.296 --> 00:00:55.722
Yeah, we talked you into it.

00:00:56.549 --> 00:00:57.671
Yeah, but I agreed.

00:00:59.093 --> 00:01:02.192
I tried so hard to help,
and all it's done is make things worse.

00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:06.746
Anyway, that doesn't matter anymore.

00:01:08.769 --> 00:01:12.242
Because I don't want to play anymore.
All it does is make you care too much.

00:01:13.148 --> 00:01:14.928
And the more you care,
the more you have to lose.

00:01:15.985 --> 00:01:18.234
-So maybe it's just better to....
-To what?

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.755
To go it alone.

00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:25.081
Psst.

00:01:29.665 --> 00:01:30.803
Hagrid.

00:01:35.087 --> 00:01:36.586
Any idea where he's taking us?

00:01:37.673 --> 00:01:39.689
Hagrid, why can't you just tell us?

00:01:49.059 --> 00:01:51.729
I've never seen the centaurs so riled.

00:01:51.895 --> 00:01:53.511
And they're dangerous
at the best of times.

00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:57.735
The Ministry restricts
their territory much more...

00:01:57.901 --> 00:02:00.112
...they'll have a full uprising
on their hands.

00:02:00.279 --> 00:02:01.597
Hagrid, what's going on?

00:02:02.114 --> 00:02:04.325
I'm sorry to be so mysterious, you three.

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.411
I wouldn't be bothering
you at all with it,

00:02:07.328 --> 00:02:08.486
but with Dumbledore gone...

00:02:10.122 --> 00:02:12.782
...I'll likely be getting the sack
any day now.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.064
And I just couldn't leave
without telling someone about him.

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:22.331
Grawpy.

00:02:25.179 --> 00:02:27.306
Down here, you great buffoon.

00:02:32.686 --> 00:02:34.314
Oh, Grawpy.

00:02:36.106 --> 00:02:37.256
Brought you some company.

00:02:50.162 --> 00:02:51.684
I couldn't just leave him, because--

00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:54.333
Because he's my brother.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.626
Blimey.

00:02:55.793 --> 00:02:57.836
Well, half brother, really.

00:02:58.045 --> 00:03:00.339
He's completely harmless,
just like I said.

00:03:00.506 --> 00:03:02.738
Little high-spirited, is all.

00:03:05.636 --> 00:03:07.888
- Grawpy, that is not polite.
- Hagrid, do something.

00:03:08.055 --> 00:03:10.307
We talked about this.
You do not grab, do you?

00:03:10.474 --> 00:03:12.726
That's your new friend, Hermione.

00:03:12.893 --> 00:03:14.186
Grawpy.

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:19.692
Grawp.

00:03:21.735 --> 00:03:23.812
Put me down.

00:03:28.492 --> 00:03:29.557
Now.

00:03:42.214 --> 00:03:43.298
You all right?

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:45.790
Fine.

00:03:46.677 --> 00:03:47.991
Just needs a firm hand, is all.

00:03:49.138 --> 00:03:50.558
I think you've got an admirer.

00:03:54.101 --> 00:03:56.228
You just stay away from her, all right?

00:04:26.341 --> 00:04:28.096
He gets his own food and all.

00:04:30.345 --> 00:04:33.432
It's company he'll be needing
when I'm gone.

00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:36.387
You will look after him, won't you?

00:04:37.478 --> 00:04:39.169
I'm the only family he's got.

00:04:53.786 --> 00:04:55.662
Feeling sentimental?

00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:01.983
-That's private.
-Not to me.

00:05:03.045 --> 00:05:05.918
And not to the Dark Lord,
if you don't improve.

00:05:08.967 --> 00:05:12.137
Every memory he has access to
is a weapon he can use against you.

00:05:12.304 --> 00:05:15.325
You won't last two seconds
if he invades your mind.

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.175
You're just like your father.

00:05:20.062 --> 00:05:21.855
Lazy, arrogant.

00:05:22.022 --> 00:05:24.274
-Don't say a word against my father.
-Weak.

00:05:24.441 --> 00:05:26.610
-I'm not weak.
-Then prove it.

00:05:27.236 --> 00:05:28.904
Control your emotions.

00:05:29.321 --> 00:05:30.912
Discipline your mind.

00:05:35.118 --> 00:05:36.328
Legilimens.

00:05:43.502 --> 00:05:44.628
Harry.

00:05:44.795 --> 00:05:46.505
Sirius.

00:05:47.214 --> 00:05:48.707
I may vomit.

00:05:48.799 --> 00:05:49.842
Stop it.

00:05:51.009 --> 00:05:53.303
Is this what you call control?

00:05:53.804 --> 00:05:55.829
We've been at it for hours.
If I could just rest.

00:05:56.405 --> 00:05:59.585
The Dark Lord isn't resting.

00:06:02.062 --> 00:06:05.399
You and Black, you're two of a kind.
Sentimental children forever whining...

00:06:05.566 --> 00:06:08.110
...about how bitterly unfair
your lives have been.

00:06:08.277 --> 00:06:11.655
Well, it may have escaped your notice,
but life isn't fair.

00:06:11.822 --> 00:06:15.624
Your blessed father knew that.
In fact, he frequently saw to it.

00:06:15.731 --> 00:06:18.996
-My father was a great man.
-Your father was a swine.

00:06:20.038 --> 00:06:21.540
-Legilimens.
-Protego.

00:06:27.087 --> 00:06:28.630
Come on, Moony, Padfoot.

00:06:28.797 --> 00:06:30.883
Snape. Expelliarmus.

00:06:31.049 --> 00:06:32.885
Nice one, James.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.554
- Dad.
- Impedimenta.

00:06:35.762 --> 00:06:37.723
Snivellus Greasy. Snivellus Greasy.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.559
Right. Who wants to see me
take off Snivelly's trousers?

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:42.978
Snivellus Greasy. Snivellus Greasy.

00:06:43.145 --> 00:06:44.354
Enough.

00:06:46.475 --> 00:06:47.900
Enough.

00:06:56.408 --> 00:06:59.036
Your lessons are at an end.

00:06:59.202 --> 00:07:00.329
I--

00:07:00.495 --> 00:07:02.350
Get out.

